    <item>
      <title>Camera Poses in Inventory (1.4.3)</title>
      <author>VenomF</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/743534</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/743534#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a3bcbe0d3cd06ac7117964e439c1811727d372ae</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:29:18 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b011ea97cb2a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b011e8e05992.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Update v1.2&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update v1.2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You now can rotate the character at any tab (right stick), and the rotation will remain until you close the inventory (The pose remains until changing tab or closing inventory). This allows for more freedom in this menu when trying on armor, plus the option to strike poses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Better smooth transition between all the poses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 dir="ltr" aria-level="4"&gt;Pouch Camera Poses (BETA) for 1.4.3&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Game version:&lt;/strong&gt; 1.4.3 only | &lt;strong&gt;Tested on:&lt;/strong&gt; totk-pc-recomp (PC) | &lt;strong&gt;Status:&lt;/strong&gt; Beta&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Ever wanted Link in the inventory to strike the same poses you get in camera mode? That’s what this does. In the &lt;strong&gt;Armor&lt;/strong&gt; tab, press &lt;strong&gt;X&lt;/strong&gt; and Link cycles through the 11 camera-mode poses (the &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;SelfCameraPose_*&lt;/code&gt; set), then goes back to his normal idle. Switch tabs and it resets to vanilla. Every other tab is left alone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5"&gt;Features:&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Press X in the Armor tab to go through the poses, one per press with smooth transition. The 12th press brings back the normal idle.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Changing tabs resets the pose, so you always start from the vanilla idle.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Weapon, bow and shield poses, the Holding screen and the eating/drinking animations are untouched.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;While a camera pose is active, the cold/hot idle variations don’t play. When you’re on the vanilla pose/step they work as usual.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;When you change the character's rotation (using the right stick), it will remain the same on every tab until you close the inventory.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;I hope this mod encourages modders to make new fresh animations for Link/Linkle/Zelda or any character you have in mind....&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5"&gt;Installation&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ol dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Put the mod inside your mods folder. If you use the recomp, rebuild it with the mod installed.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&lt;h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5"&gt;Beta warnings&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version-locked:&lt;/strong&gt; the patch only matches build ID &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;277178B7DBA1B6D4949A84778D4ABC58B31B34F5&lt;/code&gt; (1.4.3). Other versions won’t work.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Only tested on the PC recomp.&lt;/strong&gt; Emulators and Switch are untested. In theory it should apply, but I can’t promise anything yet. If you try it, tell me what happened.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conflicts:&lt;/strong&gt; don’t use it with another mod that replaces &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;PouchPlayer.pack.zs&lt;/code&gt; or edits the same exefs spots.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;No on-screen prompt yet, so for now you just have to know X does it.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Update v1.2:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;You now can rotate the character at any tab (right stick), and the rotation will remain until you close the inventory (The pose remains until changing tab or closing inventory). This allows for more freedom in this menu when trying on armor, plus the option to strike poses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;New&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Better smooth transition between all the poses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5"&gt;Planned for the next update&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;A proper button prompt for the Armor tab (if it can be done through data without touching the layout archive and breaking other UI mods).&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;More testing on emulators and, if it works out, notes for Switch.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Maybe hold-X to jump back to the vanilla idle.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Looking into a version-independent way to generate the patch, so it isn’t stuck on 1.4.3.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5"&gt;Credits&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;totk-pc-recomp&lt;/strong&gt; by valentderah, for the recompilation this was built and tested on.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TKVSC&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AINB-Toolbox&lt;/strong&gt; (VillainousSnake) and &lt;strong&gt;Ghidra&lt;/strong&gt;, used for the data edits and for digging through &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Claude (Anthropic)&lt;/strong&gt;, which helped with the reverse engineering notes, the patch code, the ASB/AINB edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/camera_poses_in_inventory_143_v12.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/camera_poses_in_inventory_143_v11.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/camera_poses_in_inventory_143_.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Inventory</category>
      <category>UI</category>
    </item>
