      <title>Gerudofied Flamebreaker Armor</title>
      <author>MarioBroz7</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/744366</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/744366#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cfdae609c7e99fa963c3e0a85eb1218e27a5d22d</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:13:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b0353238c692.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b0353238b886.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b0353238ed2c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b0353238e808.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;I always loved how the royal gerudo dress looked on Riju. What inspired me to do this is after seeing the armor's that were made in PotatoFried's DOTK x Playable Riju Mod patch, so I wanted to try something similar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So, for a while I been thinking about a way to try to incorporate the dress be part of an armor set and then the wacky idea came up out of the blue which led to me making this very armor you see here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;I wasn't really a fan of the original flame breaker set because it doesn't really fit Riju in my honest opinion.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;After playing around with stuff in blender, I'm really happy how it turned it out. The very stuff that you see on the legs is from the arm mesh. I used shrink-wrap to fit it on Riju's legs and surprisingly it worked out well and it looks great lol!&amp;nbsp; As for the arms I made, I proportion edit one part of the arm mesh, mirrored it and bingo instant 2nd arm mesh.&lt;br&gt;Finally, for the waist did the same thing for that and fits on with her shape perfectly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I tried my best covering up RIju's body so it can actually look like a flame breaker outfit there's some parts exposed but I'm fine with it. For the head I added some parts from the ember set and fusing it with the crown looks cool and diverse.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In the future I will make dyes for this eventually since I'm currently working on making dyes for my Mario sports outfit pack. I'm planning on making dyes for all the outfit mods that I have published for the playable Riju mod so far.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Yes, that includes the Nayru Water Dress, Inferno Stable Trotter, and etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;(excluding the flamin stable trotter and snowcation dress mods though lol)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anyways, with that said enjoy the mod. This is probably the best mod I made for Riju so far lmao, I will try doing something like this again on some other sets but that's later on.</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/gerudofied_flame_breaker_set.rar" type="application/vnd.rar"/>
