    <item>
      <title>Playable Riju + Linkle Animations</title>
      <author>kjuian</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/742671</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/742671#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3c9236ad08757f798cf6464f2fd7af4b07545274</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:52:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6afe7caaad43d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6afe7da28b768.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Play as Riju with Linkle's feminine animations&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;A ready-to-play, pre-merged combination of &lt;b&gt;Playable Riju&lt;/b&gt; by #1RijuFan and the animation set from &lt;b&gt;The Linkle Mod&lt;/b&gt; by legend5v and team. All character, outfit and animation work belongs to the original authors (see Credits). This upload only combines them and fixes the problems that come up when you run them together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What's included&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Riju as the playable character, with all her outfits and her spear moves&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Linkle's idle, walk and run animations on Riju&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;All of Riju's outfit edits pre-merged (normally these need TKMM to apply)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fixes in this version&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Invisible arms on sleeveless outfits fixed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Barefoot and footwear footstep sounds fixed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Footstep sounds restored on Linkle's walk and run animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Riju's temperature resistance and lightning charge attack now load properly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cloth and hair physics on Riju's outfits now load properly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Not included&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Riju's two custom weapons, item text and save-data edits. Those still need the original Riju mod through TKMM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Compatibility&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Built and tested on game version &lt;b&gt;1.4.3&lt;/b&gt;. Do not use alongside the separate Playable Riju or Linkle mods, or other mods that change the player, outfits or the ResourceSizeTable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Credits&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;#1RijuFan&lt;/b&gt;: Playable Riju Mod (model, outfits, animations, armor edits)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;legend5v&lt;/b&gt; and the Linkle Mod team (Lady_Quanxi, Aster, DietCreamss, caryllrune, Palio Polio): The Linkle Mod for TotK&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;lynard killer&lt;/b&gt;, PeregrineHBG, pokisofiii and Moonling: the original BotW Linkle Mod&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;i2m&lt;/b&gt;, with Sockpoppet, Amiibolad and Mythrax: Girly Animation Pack (the feminine animations)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lord Bubbles, The5thTear and Orange_v2: Linkle Mod contributors&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;KJUIAN&lt;/b&gt;: merge, fixes and packaging&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please go support the original mods!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
