t; mod to hide fused material.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Electric damage&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Shoots orb&lt;/span&gt; when attacking (download the orb version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bolt of Gransax can be purchased from &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Beedle&lt;/span&gt; in &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Woodland Stable&lt;/span&gt; for 1,000 Rupees.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The mod is tested on the latest version of the game.</description>
