    <item>
      <title>Zonai Fieldworks</title>
      <author>HanSoloBlaster</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739060</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/739060#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">752f0b312aa66053c8e7b8cfc1cc03e61f0c02c9</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:31:58 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2ca97ad.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa536c053.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2ca9b3e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2caa9c2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2cb6445.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2cc9cf4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2caa509.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6af3fa2caad8a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Mod Conflicts Fix&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Detects and alerts user to potential mod conflicts. No longer disables mod completely for conflicts affecting only one sub-mod. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Notice&lt;/span&gt;: I now suggest people download this mod from &lt;a href="https://hansoloblaster.dev/#mods" target="_blank"&gt;my website&lt;/a&gt; instead of here. You'll find the latest updates there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Zonai Fieldworks&lt;/h1&gt;Eight of my mods in one download, for emulators and Switch. Each one normally takes up its own code slot, so running all of them leaves no room for anything else. This puts them all in one slot (&lt;code&gt;subsdk6&lt;/code&gt;) and adds a page to the ability wheel where you turn each one on or off while playing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The "all in one" includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/712703"&gt;Phantom Foothold&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; - climb any surface&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;No buttons: every surface with collision is climbable, ceilings included.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/718323"&gt;Zonai Hookshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (with Arrowbound)&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;ZL + L&lt;/b&gt; to aim, &lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt; to fire and zip to a climbable wall, &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt; to cancel.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Arrowbound: activate its emblem in Key Items, then shoot an arrow to ride it. &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt; lets go.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/719972"&gt;Fleet Sync&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click both sticks beside a Steering Stick to make it the controller, then beside up to four identical vehicles to link them.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold both stick clicks for 1.5 seconds to clear the links.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/733845"&gt;Material Columns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;D-pad Up&lt;/b&gt; and press &lt;b&gt;Y&lt;/b&gt; until Material Columns shows. The right stick picks a category, then up/down for an item in the category.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Materials from other mods can get their own category with an INI file: &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/blob/main/material-columns/docs/CATEGORY-CONFIG.md" target="_blank"&gt;guide for mod authors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/726588"&gt;BotW Abilities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; - Stasis, Remote Bombs, Cryonis, Wolf Link and the Champions&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;L&lt;/b&gt; and tap &lt;b&gt;R&lt;/b&gt; for the second wheel page: Stasis, Remote Bombs (tap &lt;b&gt;L&lt;/b&gt; to set them off), Cryonis and Wolf Link.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Champions trigger on their own: Daruk on &lt;b&gt;ZL&lt;/b&gt;, Revali by holding jump through a landing, Urbosa on a charged spin attack, Mipha when your hearts run out.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/718525"&gt;Bivouac&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Eat a Hearty Truffle, Big Hearty Truffle or Big Hearty Radish while climbing to build a camp.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt; on a camp in the map to travel there. Hold &lt;b&gt;ZL + ZR&lt;/b&gt; and tap &lt;b&gt;D-pad Left&lt;/b&gt; near one to take it down.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715735"&gt;Self Recall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;ZL + R3&lt;/b&gt; for a second to rewind Link through his last 64 seconds. &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt; stops.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/713365"&gt;Zonai Survey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;ZL + D-pad Up&lt;/b&gt; to scan the landscape and show collectibles with names and icons.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Each mod works the same as its own release, so check its page for the controls. You either get the all in one or get the separate mods, using both at once will cause issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;How to use&lt;/h3&gt;Everything starts &lt;b&gt;off&lt;/b&gt;. Hold L to open the ability wheel and tap R until you get to the Fieldworks page, then release on a mod's icon to switch it. Your choices are saved in &lt;code&gt;ZonaiFieldworks/settings.txt&lt;/code&gt; on the SD card.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Turning a mod off removes whatever it put in the world (bombs, Cryonis pillars, Wolf Link, your camps and their map markers). Camps come back when you turn Bivouac on again.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phantom Foothold is the exception:&lt;/b&gt; its switch only affects areas loaded after you flip it, so fast travel or enter a shrine to see the change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Install&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;TotK &lt;b&gt;1.2.1&lt;/b&gt; or &lt;b&gt;1.4.3&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Emulator: extract the &lt;code&gt;Zonai Fieldworks&lt;/code&gt; folder into your emulator's mod folder for the game.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Switch: copy the &lt;code&gt;0100F2C0115B6000&lt;/code&gt; folder from the Switch download into &lt;code&gt;atmosphere/contents&lt;/code&gt; on your SD card. Keep its &lt;code&gt;main.npdm&lt;/code&gt;, a bigger one from another mod leaves the game short on memory.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ryujinx/Ryubing: use the Switch download. Put its &lt;code&gt;exefs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;romfs&lt;/code&gt; folders into a new folder in the game's mod folder.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Disable the standalone versions of the eight mods above, and any other mod that uses &lt;code&gt;subsdk6&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;This ships its own &lt;code&gt;ResourceSizeTable&lt;/code&gt; (RESTBL) for each game version. If you use other mods with one, merge them with a mod manager.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Get these separately&lt;/h3&gt;These two are patch files, not code mods, so they are not in Fieldworks and don't use a code slot. They work alongside it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/734679"&gt;Ultimate Ascend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; - Ascend down through floors to the Depths, and through glued platforms. All versions from 1.0.0 to 1.4.3.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/722145"&gt;Drive-by&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; - use your bow, weapons and shield while holding a Steering Stick. 1.2.1 only.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Source and the full README: &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/zonai-fieldworks" target="_blank"&gt;github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods&lt;/a&gt;. Uses exlaunch by shadowninja108.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AI Disclaimer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod was built with thel help of Claude Fable 5.2.</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/zonai-fieldworks-v080-emulator-subsdk6.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/zonai-fieldworks-v081-emulator-subsdk6.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/zonai-fieldworks-v093-emulator-subsdk6.zip" type="application/zip"/>
