      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac01ba492353.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac01ba495aa1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fbae897.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Support TotK v1.4.3&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adds support for Tears of the Kingdom 1.4.3. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Zonai Hookshot&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Notice&lt;/span&gt;: I now suggest people download this mod from &lt;a href="https://hansoloblaster.dev/#mods" target="_blank"&gt;my website&lt;/a&gt; instead of here. You'll find the latest updates there. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recent changes:&lt;/h2&gt;Activation is now &lt;b&gt;ZL + L&lt;/b&gt; (sorry this was inaccurate for awhile)&lt;br&gt;Added &lt;b&gt;Arrowbound&lt;/b&gt;. Enable by selecting the Arrowbound emblem in the main menu. &lt;b&gt;Shoot an arrow and you will paraglide along its trajectory&lt;/b&gt;. Disable via the same emblem. &lt;b&gt;Still in early alpha status. Only works with slower bows/arrows. &lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;Use Rauru's arm to activate a zonai-style "hookshot".&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Controls&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;ZL + L&lt;/b&gt; (best to hold ZL first, then L) to enter aim mode. A green circle marks a wall the glideshot will accept. A red circle means it won't work.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;A &lt;/b&gt;to fire. The Zonai Hookshot draws to the target at once and Link follows. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;B &lt;/b&gt;at any point to let go.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirmed working on Switch. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Known issues&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sometimes the target is missed by a bit or doesn't latch onto a climb when arriving.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sometimes Link ends up inside a wall...&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Open source&lt;/h2&gt;Both this mod and its source code are fully open source and MIT licensed. You can find the source code &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/glideshot" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;Coded with help from Opus, Sol. For an outline of how I use AI to make mods, see &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739"&gt;https://gamebanana.com/posts/13964739&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Credits&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;exlaunch by shadowninja108 and contributors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;doctest (MIT); devkitPro.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Donations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy my work, feel free to &lt;a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/hansoloblaster" target="_blank"&gt;buy me a coffee&lt;/a&gt;! I provide the mod and its source code completely free and open source. I stand by that; so only donate if you're feeling friendly or would like to boost my spirits!</description>
